# ArduCopter V4.7.2: the settings of ArduPilot's tuning guide ("Setting the
# aircraft up for tuning") for a 5-inch propeller and a 6-cell pack that are
# not in base.parm (ADR-0007 section 2 step 1). It is loaded for the tuning
# flights (`oxide-bridge tune`) and, after them, for every bridged flight.
# Not set here, on purpose: MOT_THST_EXPO and MOT_THST_HOVER (base.parm: the
# airframe's own thrust curve, and a hover thrust below the expected one for
# the program to learn), MOT_SPIN_ARM, MOT_SPIN_MIN and MOT_SPIN_MAX (the
# defaults, the last one the guide's 0.95), ATC_ACC_R_MAX, ATC_ACC_P_MAX and
# ATC_ACC_Y_MAX (the guide gives no 5-inch value: the tuner sets them) and
# AUTOTUNE_AGGR and AUTOTUNE_MIN_D (the defaults).

# Battery: the guide's "Battery setting" rule, 4.2 V per cell full and 3.3 V
# per cell empty; our pack has 6 cells.
MOT_BAT_VOLT_MAX 25.2
MOT_BAT_VOLT_MIN 19.8

# Filters: the guide gives the accelerometer filter 10 Hz and, for a 5-inch
# propeller, the gyro filter 80 Hz.
INS_ACCEL_FILTER 10
INS_GYRO_FILTER 80

# The rate controllers' target and derivative filters are half the gyro
# filter (the guide's rule), 40 Hz.
ATC_RAT_RLL_FLTT 40
ATC_RAT_RLL_FLTD 40
ATC_RAT_PIT_FLTT 40
ATC_RAT_PIT_FLTD 40
ATC_RAT_YAW_FLTT 40

# The yaw error filter: the guide's 2 Hz.
ATC_RAT_YAW_FLTE 2
